rk, see you soon! Take care!\n[S28T42] (dia_id: D28:42)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, Dave! Exploring different styles and times can open up new perspectives. Broadening your musical knowledge is awesome. Good luck with work, see ya!\n\n\n[Image caption: a photo of a record player sitting on the floor next to a couch]\n[S28T43] (dia_id: D28:43)","text_sha256":"b89c53ee97458ab1d7a559d5adcbfb92bbdfc77dec281ec439494482575ae2c6","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:21"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":85,"line_start":84,"source_locators":["[S28T21]"],"text_sha256":"dc45070fc4e7ee4a9b399e5b163af4cbf54d7e4a2bbf91b2697cd6d037ea24cb"},{"dia_ids":["D28:22"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":89,"line_start":87,"source_locators":["[S28T22]"],"text_sha256":"eae963e463c022ec0f39d68c665505dc194110bef9eec10f5cf21cf66df68975"},{"dia_ids":["D28:23"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":92,"line_start":91,"source_locators":["[S28T23]"],"text_sha256":"169523e38d9f37981cab62dbc50bd932739be20a1e2d0c0727fa77fa1ccf894d"},{"dia_ids":["D28:24"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":95,"line_start":94,"source_locators":["[S28T24]"],"text_sha256":"eb19d9949385e10395c07423f937599f8db6ee82360f6b231c32f55c3e8df763"},{"dia_ids":["D28:25"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":98,"line_start":97,"source_locators":["[S28T25]"],"text_sha256":"a3edc50bb7086ccb83e7dd8bdccef298309c5f33f3fa53c6d6bb74db24e588ae"},{"dia_ids":["D28:26"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":101,"line_start":100,"source_locators":["[S28T26]"],"text_sha256":"c54f2479bd5116489082b440368d06c20a94ff74cd694f00fed8962925c3d6d8"},{"dia_ids":["D28:27"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":105,"line_start":103,"source_locators":["[S28T27]"],"text_sha256":"574c6f0ede34431d520e23bc2a0cf7da0d339dd507f4b9d08284caa635102f2e"},{"dia_ids":["D28:28"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":108,"line_start":107,"source_locators":["[S28T28]"],"text_sha256":"2b000439357127aef448b1b74be06b