ha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Wow, Dave, that is an awesome job on restoring it! You've got some serious skills!\n[S28T21] (dia_id: D28:21)\n\nDave: Thanks Calvin! It took some work, but I'm happy with the result. Take a look at the logo we created for our rock band!\n[Image caption: a photography of a guitar logo with the company band logo]\n[S28T22] (dia_id: D28:22)\n\nCalvin: Cool logo, Dave! What's the story behind it?\n[S28T23] (dia_id: D28:23)\n\nDave: Cool! It's the logo for my rock band. I've been a fan for ages and have had the opportunity to join them.\n[S28T24] (dia_id: D28:24)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave! Music really has a way of touching our souls.\n[S28T25] (dia_id: D28:25)\n\nDave: Yeah, Calvin! It's amazing how music can really move us. It's almost like a language for our souls.\n[S28T26] (dia_id: D28:26)\n\nCalvin: Yup, it's that connection I'm aiming for with my music. Take a loot at my studio setup, that's look awesome, isn't it?\n[Image caption: a photography of a recording studio with a monitor, keyboard, and monitor]\n[S28T27] (dia_id: D28:27)\n\nDave: Wow, your studio looks stunning! How do you like hanging out here? Do you watch much TV?\n[S28T28] (dia_id: D28:28)\n\nCalvin: I only work in the studio. I have another room for relaxation with a TV, just take a look that room is cozy and relaxing. And yeah, It's a great way to unwind and get inspired.\n[Image caption: a photo of a living room with a couch, chair, television and a table]\n[S28T29] (dia_id: D28:29)\n\nDave: Wow, nice setup! What do you usually watch on it?\n[S28T30] (dia_id: D28:30)","text_sha256":"57f19804d75ec7bef4b25de5b91f2fbf8bcd3f62c0abc2f73c7176ddd0e85b67","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":